{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01576","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恨凌辱兮恶腥膻，憎胡地兮怨胡天。\n生得胡儿欲弃捐，及生母子情宛然。\n貌殊语异憎还爱，心中不觉常相牵。\n朝朝暮暮在眼前，腹生手养宁不怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}